$ mp calendar reminder --help
Dismiss or snooze one event's reminder, in every client and in Outlook

Usage: mp calendar reminder [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  dismiss  Dismiss the reminder: it does not fire again for this meeting
  snooze   Snooze the reminder: it fires again in --minutes
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
