$ mp daemon --help
Manage the local mailypoppins daemon (run, start, status, stop, restart)

Usage: mp daemon [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run                Run the daemon in the foreground; never connects to another daemon
  start              Start the daemon (via the login service if installed) and return once it answers
  status             Report whether a daemon is running against this data directory
  stop               Ask the running daemon to shut down
  restart            Stop the running daemon and start this executable's (via the login service if installed)
  install-service    Install the login-start service for this user and enable it
  uninstall-service  Disable the login-start service and remove its file
  health             Report the running daemon's health, its counters and its checks
  logs               Print the tail of the daemon's own structured log
  support-bundle     Write a redacted support bundle and say what went into it
  help               Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <NAME>  Profile to run on, with its own config, data and daemon (default: $MAILYPOPPINS_PROFILE, else the default profile)
  -h, --help            Print help

